
Manual for the Nbody6++ code by Sverre Aarseth and Rainer Spurzem.
------------------------------------------------------------------

Location:  ftp://ftp.ari.uni-heidelberg.de/pub/staff/spurzem/nb6mpi/
Downloadfile:  nb6manual.tar.gz
Authors:  Emil Khalisi, Rainer Spurzem
Last update: 2005, Feb 15


In order read the manual, unpack it

   ...>  gzip -d -c nb6manual.tar.gz | tar xvf -

and open the PostScript-file

   ...> gv nb6manual/broschure.ps


